  "chapter": {
    "number": 1,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Blessed is the man who doesn’t walk in the counsel of the wicked,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "nor stand on the path of sinners,",
            "poem": 2
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          },
          {
            "text": "nor sit in the seat of scoffers;",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "but his delight is in Yahweh’s",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 0
          },
          {
            "text": "law.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "On his law he meditates day and night.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "He will be like a tree planted by the streams of water,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "that produces its fruit in its season,",
            "poem": 2
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          },
          {
            "text": "whose leaf also does not wither.",
            "poem": 2
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Whatever he does shall prosper.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The wicked are not so,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "but are like the chaff which the wind drives away.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Therefore the wicked shall not stand in the judgment,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "nor sinners in the congregation of the righteous.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For Yahweh knows the way of the righteous,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "but the way of the wicked shall perish.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
      {
        "noteId": 0,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "“Yahweh” is God’s proper Name, sometimes rendered “LORD” (all caps) in other translations.",
